\item Any other \code{evid} value, including rxode2's codes above 6 and its
classic codes of 100 and more, such as the 101 in
\code{nlmixr2data::theo_sd}, which fold the compartment into the number.
\item \code{ss = 2}, NONMEM's steady state added to the current state rather
than replacing it. \code{\link[=frm_ode]{frm_ode()}}'s steady state starts from an empty
